| Phase | Days | Risk |
|---|---|---|
| 1. Settings foundation + adapter | 1.0 | low |
| 2. Provider catalog + discovery | 0.5 | low |
| 3. Base contracts + runtime hooks | 0.5 | low |
| 4. TTS migration | 1.0 | low |
